{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q949862","formula":"Fe₂(TeO₃)₃·2H₂O","hill":"Fe2H4O11Te3","elements":["H","O","Fe","Te"],"composition":{"H":4.0,"O":11.0,"Fe":2.0,"Te":3.0},"names":{"en":"Emmonsite","uk":"Емонсит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Emmonsite, also known as durdenite, is an iron tellurite mineral with the formula: Fe2(TeO3)3·2(H2O). Emmonsite forms triclinic crystals. It is of a yellowish-green color, with a vitreous luster, and a hardness of 5 on the Moh scale.","uk":"Емонсит — мінерал, телурит заліза з формулою: Fe2(TeO3)3·2(H2O). Емонсит утворює триклінні кристали, має жовтувато-зелений колір, склоподібний блиск і має твердість 5 за шкалою Мооса. Емонсит вперше був описаний у 1885 році в районі Тумстоун, округ Кочіс, штат Аризона."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q949862","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emmonsite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%95%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Emmonsite-155152.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q3438122","formula":"Fe₂(TeO₂OH)₃(TeO₃)Cl","names":{"en":"Rodalquilarite","uk":"Родалкіларит"},"elements":["H","O","Cl","Fe","Te"],"fame":9,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q24629258","formula":"HO₄PPb","names":{"en":"Dibasic lead phosphate","ru":"Гидрофосфат свинца(II)"},"elements":["H","O","P","Pb"],"fame":1,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q3705271","formula":"Pb₂Cu₅(UO₂)₂(SeO₃)₆(OH)₆·2H₂O","names":{"en":"Demesmaekerite","uk":"Демесмекерит"},"elements":["H"